entries[163020] = { ["name"] = "Schematic: Honorable Combatant's Discombobulator", ["text"] = "Rank 2\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft Honorable Combatant's Discombobulator more efficiently.\nReduce the materials required to craft an Honorable Combatant's Discombobulator.\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering (1)\nSell Price:\nHonorable Combatant's Discombobulator\nBinds when equipped\nOne-Hand Mace\n8 - 10 Damage Speed 2.60\n(3.5 damage per second)\n+3 Agility\n+5 Stamina\nDurability 90 / 90\n\"Its magnetism revolves around its ability to attract opponent's skulls into its striking surface.\"\nSell Price:\nRequires Storm Silver Ore (22), Platinum Ore (10), Expulsom (6)" }
